{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Contact</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to book or ask about our sound-led gatherings and private experiences.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1720;--card:#0b1220;--muted:#9aa6b2;--accent:#9ad1c7;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);--maxw:980px}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Segoe UI, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;color:#e6eef3;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071019 0%,#071827 60%),url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:320px;}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:48px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);}    
    header{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#122b2a,#0e1621);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:#fff}
    .hero{margin-top:18px;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px;color:#e9fbf6}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-card{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:#e8f6f2}
    textarea{min-height:100px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6fd0b8);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;color:#04201b;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .mixer{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
    .mixer button{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .mixer button.active{background:rgba(154,209,199,0.12);border-color:rgba(154,209,199,0.3);color:var(--accent)}
    .recommend{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent)}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .proof{margin-top:18px}
    .testimonial{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);min-height:96px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;position:relative;cursor:default}
    .badge:hover .tip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    .tip{position:absolute;bottom:120%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(8px);background:#071827;color:#dff3ef;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px;opacity:0;transition:all .18s}
    footer{margin-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#b9c7cc}
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand .logo{width:48px;height:48px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div>
        <h1 id="contact-title">Connect with our events team</h1>
        <p class="lead">Tell us what you need — a community evening, a focused reset, or a private session — and we'll suggest the best fit. For fast replies, call us at <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>.</p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <form id="contactForm">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First and last" required>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>

            <div class="row">
              <div>
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(optional)">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="city">City</label>
                <input id="city" name="city" placeholder="{{CITY}}">
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="note">What are you looking for?</label>
            <textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="Tell us about your group, date range, and any needs"></textarea>

            <div class="small">Pick your preferred sound intensity to tailor our suggestions</div>
            <div class="mixer" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Sound intensity">
              <button type="button" class="mix" data-level="gentle">Gentle</button>
              <button type="button" class="mix active" data-level="medium">Balanced</button>
              <button type="button" class="mix" data-level="intense">Dynamic</button>
            </div>

            <div class="recommend" id="recommend">
              <div class="small">Recommended formats</div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px" id="programList">
                <!-- JS inserts recommendations -->
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
              <button class="btn" id="primaryCta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <button type="button" class="secondary" id="quickCall">Call {{PHONE}}</button>
            </div>

            <div id="formStatus" class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
          </form>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside class="contact-card">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
          <div>
            <div class="small">Fast booking</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;margin-top:6px">Reserve a slot — group or private</div>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">We offer recurring series and single events; pricing and packages are flexible per group size.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="proof">
            <div class="small">Proof gallery</div>
            <div class="testimonial" id="testimonial">
              <!-- rotating testimonial -->
            </div>
            <div class="badges" id="badges">
              <!-- credibility badges -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <div class="small">Quick details</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and nearby communities — flexible schedules. Phone: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:12px">Important: Sound gatherings are gentle but can affect people with certain conditions. Contraindications include pregnancy (consult your provider), epilepsy, recent head/ear surgery, severe cardiovascular conditions, and implants sensitive to vibration. If in doubt, check with your healthcare practitioner before attending. If you have accessibility needs, contact us and we will adapt when possible.</div>

    <footer>
      <div class="small">Contact: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <div><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn">Secure a spot</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Recommendations based on sound intensity
    (function(){
      const programs = {
        gentle: [
          {name:'Morning Drift — Short reset',desc:'30–40 min. Soft sustained tones and breath guidance.'},
          {name:'Luminous Pause — Community seat',desc:'45 min. Soothing bowls with gentle chimes.'}
        ],
        medium: [
          {name:'Grounding Sequence — Group',desc:'60 min. Layered bowls, light percussion, seated practice.'},
          {name:'Collective Reset — Series',desc:'Four-week progression for stability and focus.'}
        ],
        intense: [
          {name:'Release Arc — Immersive',desc:'75–90 min. Broad frequency palette, dynamic peaks for release.'},
          {name:'Deep Resonance — Small cohort',desc:'90 min. Intimate setting, deeper vibrational work.'}
        ]
      };

      const mixButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.mix');
      const programList = document.getElementById('programList');
      const testimonialEl = document.getElementById('testimonial');
      const badgesEl = document.getElementById('badges');

      let currentLevel = 'medium';

      function renderPrograms(level){
        const list = programs[level] || programs.medium;
        programList.innerHTML = '';
        list.forEach(p=>{
          const div = document.createElement('div');
          div.style.marginBottom = '8px';
          div.innerHTML = '<div style="font-weight:700">'+p.name+'</div><div class="small">'+p.desc+'</div>';
          programList.appendChild(div);
        });
      }

      mixButtons.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
          mixButtons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
          this.classList.add('active');
          currentLevel = this.getAttribute('data-level');
          renderPrograms(currentLevel);
        });
      });

      // Initial render
      renderPrograms(currentLevel);

      // Proof gallery: rotating testimonials and badges with tooltips
      const testimonials = [
        {quote:'A precise evening — moving yet calm. The facilitators hold space well.',by:'A. Rivera — community leader'},
        {quote:'We booked a private session for our team. It reset our attention and gave everyone a common calm.',by:'M. Huang — workshop host'},
        {quote:'Attended a series; the progression was practical and steady. Tangible focus gains.',by:'T. Samuels — educator'}
      ];

      const badges = [
        {label:'Mind & Body',tip:'Featured in Mind & Body: community wellness spotlight'},
        {label:'Health Collective',tip:'Partner note: delivered workplace sessions for Health Collective clients'},
        {label:'Local Press',tip:'Local coverage: profile in neighborhood arts and wellness column'}
      ];

      let tIndex = 0;
      function showTestimonial(i){
        const t = testimonials[i];
        testimonialEl.innerHTML = '<div style="font-style:italic;">"'+t.quote+'"</div><div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">— '+t.by+'</div>';
      }

      function renderBadges(){
        badgesEl.innerHTML = '';
        badges.forEach(b=>{
          const span = document.createElement('span');
          span.className = 'badge';
          span.tabIndex = 0;
          span.innerHTML = b.label + '<div class="tip">'+b.tip+'</div>';
          badgesEl.appendChild(span);
        });
      }

      renderBadges();
      showTestimonial(0);
      setInterval(()=>{
        tIndex = (tIndex+1)%testimonials.length;
        showTestimonial(tIndex);
      },4000);

      // Form behaviour
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const status = document.getElementById('formStatus');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
      const quickCall = document.getElementById('quickCall');

      quickCall.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        window.location.href = 'tel:'+encodeURIComponent('{{PHONE}}');
      });

      primaryCta.addEventListener('click',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        // collect minimal payload and show suggested program link
        const data = {
          name:document.getElementById('name').value,
          email:document.getElementById('email').value,
          phone:document.getElementById('phone').value,
          city:document.getElementById('city').value,
          note:document.getElementById('note').value,
          preference: currentLevel
        };
        status.textContent = 'Preparing your recommended options...';
        setTimeout(()=>{
          status.textContent = '';
          // Show a lightweight summary and CTA to booking
          const chosen = ({gentle:'Morning Drift — Short reset',medium:'Grounding Sequence — Group',intense:'Release Arc — Immersive'})[currentLevel];
          if(confirm('We recommend: '+chosen+".\nWould you like to open the booking page?")){
            window.location.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
          }
        },700);
      });

      form.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        // naive local 'send'
        status.textContent = 'Sending…';
        setTimeout(()=>{
          status.textContent = 'Thanks — we will reply within 48 hours.';
          form.reset();
          // restore mixer to medium
          mixButtons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
          document.querySelector('.mix[data-level="medium"]').classList.add('active');
          currentLevel = 'medium';
          renderPrograms(currentLevel);
        },900);
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the sound-bath events site (chunk 4).

Files included:
- contact.html : Standalone contact page with styles and client-side interactivity.

Purpose and highlights:
- Provides visitors a form to reach the events team and quick-call actions using the {{PHONE}} placeholder.
- Includes a Sound Preference Mixer (Gentle / Balanced / Dynamic) that updates recommended program suggestions locally.
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials and credibility badges with hover tooltips to show provenance.
- Contraindications disclaimer present and visible near the form.
- Primary CTA uses {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and points to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.
- All textual placeholders are preserved (e.g. {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{EMAIL}}).

Notes for integration:
- This chunk references assets/img/pattern.svg for a subtle background pattern. Ensure that asset is supplied in the final bundle.
- The page is self-contained: no external fonts or CDNs are required.
- Form submission is simulated locally (no backend wired). Replace the client-side handlers to post to your endpoint when ready.

Design & accessibility:
- Color palette uses high-contrast accents and subdued background for calm presentation.
- Interactive elements include readable labels and basic keyboard focusability for badges.

How to use:
- Drop contact.html into the site root alongside the other pages (index.html, events.html, etc.).
- Replace placeholders with real values during deployment.
- Optionally wire the form to a server endpoint and update the booking URL in {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.

Seed: 98906058
Layout family: poster_hero
Voice: practical_guide
Offer: events_series
Section pack included in the site: hero,myth_vs_truth,pillars,case_notes,faq,cta

End of README."}
BUNDLE_END
